@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@customerId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### CRM liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Lifecycle portfolio dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard

### Search and page the marketing queue
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/marketing/queue?limit=10&offset=0&search=Northstar

### Customer activity
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events?customerId={{customerId}}

### Automation handoff notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications

### Customer details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}

### Capture a marketing lead
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/marketing/actions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "capture_lead",
  "name": "Morgan Ellis",
  "company": "Example Furnishings",
  "email": "morgan@example.com",
  "campaign": "Showroom expansion",
  "estimatedValue": 18000
}

### Engage a lead
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/marketing/actions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "engage_lead",
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}"
}

### Attempt a transition on an unknown customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/inside-sales/actions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "qualify",
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}"
}

### Generated OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
